# The point of this project is the C++ core and its ABI surface. That core is
# deliberately small, while the three client implementations and the build
# scripts are bulkier, so GitHub's largest-language rule misreported the repo.
# Excluding those makes the language badge reflect what the project is about.
# The clients are still part of the project; see the README.
clients/** linguist-vendored
*.bat linguist-vendored

# The public ABI header is C-linkage but part of the C++ core; count it as C++
# rather than letting it split the core's byte count across two languages.
core/include/*.h linguist-language=C++
